  "notes": "Government schools are primary, preparatory (إعدادية) and secondary; the Ministry moves students to a new school after Grade 6 and Grade 9 on completing their stage. 'التمهيدي' is a pre-primary year and is not a level here. Boys' model schools (المدارس النموذجية) teach boys up to Grade 4. Many private schools follow other curricula."
